  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "織物生醫材料表面處理",
    "sub_ename": "SURFACE TREATMENT OF FABRIC BIOMEDICAL MATERIALS",
    "describe_ch": "纖維材料於生醫上的應用大致可分為天然或合成纖維或織物，優勢是具有柔軟性，易加工，及耐藥品性等，但較缺乏生醫應用，若要廣泛應用於生醫材料，需透過表面改質賦予材料新功能。其技術包括化學性與物理性，如接枝聚合、電漿氣體放電、化學反應、臭氧反應等，使其具備商業應用價值。",
    "describe_eh": "The application of fiber materials in biomedicine can be roughly divided into natural or synthetic fibers or fabrics. The advantages of organic fabrics are softness, easy processing, and drug resistance, but they lack biomedical applications. If they aim to be widely used in biomedical materials, then it is necessary to impart new functions to the materials, especial in organics, through surface modification. Its technology includes chemical and physical properties, such as graft polymerization, plasma gas discharge, chemical reaction, ozone reaction, etc., making it have commercial applications.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "培育學生充分學習生醫材料的分類與基本表面處理要求及其應用範圍",
      "describe_en": "Prepare students with the ability to classify and verify the basic surface treatments on fabrics for their biomedical applications"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "培育與訓練學生因應織物生醫材料用途，選取最佳材料表面處理的專業能力",
      "describe_en": "Prepare and train students with the ability to select the optimal fabric surface treatment and cultivate them with professional ability according to the use of fabric biomedical materials"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "規劃系統單元及全製程整合之能力。",
      "describe_en": "Prepare students with ability to scheme system unit and full process integration"
    }
  ],
